_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.jekyll-metadata
Gemfile.lock
vendor/
# The prose-review documents are NOT ignored. They are the owner's own edits --
# tracked changes, hand-rewritten paragraphs -- and the round-by-round history of
# them, which is the one part of this repository that cannot be rebuilt from
# anything else. 424 KB in total. What keeps them out of the *built site* is the
# `exclude` list in _config.yml, which is a different mechanism; this file was
# briefly doing that job too (2ed180f) and should not have been.
.~lock*

# Scratch directory used by tools/preview.sh while a build is in progress.
.preview-build/

# Built by tools/deploy_review.sh. Kept out of _site so a review build --
# different url, robots.txt Disallow -- can never be published by mistake.
_review_site/
